      "value": "The names of Astypalaia’s havens in French and Italian portolan texts, along with other information of the time (testimonies about corsair contracts written on the island and marriages between privateers and local Greek women), attest not only the strong relationship that the corsairs built with Astypalaia, but also the degree of appropriation of the place by them.",
